  "releaseNotes": "WorkflowForge.Extensions.Persistence.Recovery 2.2.0\n\nBREAKING\n- RecoveryCoordinator now requires a logger: RecoveryCoordinator(provider, logger, options?). ResumeAllAsync continues past snapshots it cannot resume, and the logger is the only record of them.\n\nFixed\n- Documented that the foundryFactory MUST attach PersistenceMiddleware with the same provider. Resume replays from index 0; without that middleware every completed operation re-executes, repeating side effects.\n\nFull changelog: https://github.com/animatlabs/workflow-forge/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#220---2026-09-15",
